# NOTE: <env>.tfvars / <env>.gcs.tfbackend are NOT ignored on purpose. They hold no secrets, the
# push trigger reads them from the repository, and .gcloudignore includes this file, so ignoring
# them would also drop them from `gcloud builds submit` uploads.

